<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67486" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηνίσκος</span></b> , ὁ, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μείς</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lunar crescent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				34
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>any crescent-shaped body</i>, esp. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>covering to protect the head of statues</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1114
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Geom.,
				<i>crescent-shaped figure, lune</i>, used in finding areas,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>APr.</u>
				69a33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SE</u>
				171b15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				172a3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
			</span></i>
			<i>*Deff.</i><i><span class="en">
				36
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ διὰ τῶν μ. τετραγωνισμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
					<u>in Ph.</u>
					55.26
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>crescent-shaped line of battle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.115.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>neck-ornament,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				11(2).147
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				10
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Is.</u>
				3.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Jd.</u>
				8.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				125.17
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			=
			<i>olla,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i>
		</div>
